{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_pudd_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_pudd_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"远方的雪","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pudd_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"c3ea8b5b257447d989d40a5536c2901aed3fde250bfb1eb8b9d588ecc72c6f2c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，我正在调试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部新任干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......应该差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来把供电模块接上......谢莉卡，麻烦看一下屏幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"数据......竟然稳定下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，故障排除了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你......是我的设计出错了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是哦，只是小问题。系统的运行环境超出了通用稳压模块的控制范围，浪涌将一些元器件烧坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把损坏的元器件都换掉了，调整了稳压模块的电路，今后使用应该没有问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"这么简单的问题，我却加班到现在都没有发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你的错啦，面对这么复杂的机器，的确会很难想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不要难过......这个，给你热可可，喝了心情就会好起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......咖啡，呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁，我......我是不是不适合做一名电气工程师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要瞎想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少、至少我觉得谢莉卡在电气工程上有非常优秀的才能，而且真的很努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我总是在工作中出错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾教官说过，新人总是要在不断犯错中成长的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次的耦合电路出了问题，这一次连小故障也没有发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要换个角度想，可以算是进步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"可为了弥补错误就要加班......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，我也经常加班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不，布丁不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你的加班是帮助大家分担压力，让情况变得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟......你的技术那么厉害，连可露希尔的那些想法都能被你绘成可以投入制作的图纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你完全不用实地勘察，根据资料就能在工作室里搭建出设备的架设环境，考虑到工程的方方面面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要费很大劲才能完成的工作，对于布丁来说应该轻而易举吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我不太会安慰人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你只是遇到了一个暂时的困境，我也曾被困境所困扰，爷爷曾教过我一个面对困境的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当想要放弃时，就想想自己做这件事最开心的时候。只要坚持做下去，就一定会再次收获同样的喜悦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......你可以试试这样想一想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"最开心的时候......我有吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你什么时候最开心？我想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？我想想......应该说每次能够提前完成任务都很开心，但要说最开心的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是我在上学时，跟随哥伦比亚工程队前往萨米的那段日子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你去过萨米？就是那片北方的神秘土地，有古老冰原和巍峨山脉的萨米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为家人的关系，小时候我就去过很多次啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在书里读到过有关萨米的事，那里是不是有很多超出想象的奇异景观？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实大部分时候我都是跟着家里人在萨米度假，没有去过更神秘的萨米深处，对于萨米的印象也只有一片纯净的白色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯独那次，我是随工程队来到了湿地中的萨米聚落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一段如湿地般潮湿的旅途，并不如度假惬意，但......很特别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在，我还记得在聚落中点亮第一盏电灯时的情形，那些萨米部落的人们脸上的笑容深深印在我的脑海里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我第一次明白，科技有重塑人们生活的力量，能够带给人们......幸福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我就想，自己未来要是也能成为掌握技术的电气工程师，是不是就能继续像这样，为人们搭建通往未来的桥梁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"通往未来的......桥梁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，想通了未来要做什么，接下来只用加把劲去做就好了。你看，我现在已经是一名电气工程师啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊我想起来了，你对萨米感兴趣的话，我还有一样东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪景球，是萨米度假区的纪念品，封存了一个萨米聚落的微缩模型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的工程部干员凝视着手中的雪景球，陷入沉思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......对啊！应该是这样才对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁，非常感谢！我也明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，我不过是讲了自己的想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我！谢莉卡·威尔逊！决不能在这里轻言放弃，今后我一定会努力成长，至少要拥有独当一面的能力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不管怎么样，能打起精神来就是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"现在就行动，先去把剩余的工作认真处理完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然很在意一件你的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和、和我有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，布丁待在本舰上很长时间了吧，可露希尔小姐也说过你的技术相比刚入职时提升了很多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"既然经历过一段那么开心的时光，你没有想过再去一趟萨米吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再去萨米......吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（将信放在桌上）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是这些内容，父亲提到了过去我们在萨米度假的经历，希望我休假时能和他们再一起去萨米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，你也会梦见萨米吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，我做了一场梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在梦里，我从很高的地方俯视着那片土地，湿地沼泽、黑森林，到积雪绵延的冬牙群山，再到一望无垠的冰原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"视线所到达的地方，一切都还是记忆里的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路边的草地盖着雪睡去，夜幕扯过极光当面纱，冰原的风把它们身上的时间都吹走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，我还梦见了遇见你的那家礼品店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的伙伴们拥挤地趴在货架上，雪景球是你们的邻居。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪花飘呀飘，落在小小的聚落小屋上。我挥了挥手，灯光就点亮了屋檐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，我们是不是应该回萨米看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命......有人吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有没有谁来......帮帮我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，爸爸妈妈在家里等我一起出发，但回家的路上也可能遇到危险啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，你是说会有朋友们送我回去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算是这样，万一发动机突然在路上着火了，或者飞行器撞上一只羽兽，在空中坏掉了怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最可怕的是我刚刚走出本舰，就被石头绊倒了，而在倒下的地方，恰好有一块尖锐的碎片......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，绝对不行！我已经去不了那么远的地方了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦......还是梦里比较安全，你也是这么认为的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，我们再做一场梦吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们准备下班了，布丁，明天见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"别喝太多咖啡哦，勤奋工作虽然好，但还是要注意身体呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡走了以后，工作室里只剩下你还在加班啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡......走了？说起来，是有段时间没有见到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你不知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡她通过了外勤部的技术考核，两个月前就已经离开本舰去执行任务了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡有相当大的进步......迎接新的挑战对她来说也不错吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"听说因为能参加心仪的任务，出发前一天她兴奋得一晚上没有睡着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也难怪，能作为哥伦比亚工程队的随行顾问前往萨米，换做我也会开心得不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，她竟然去了萨米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得布丁过去也去过萨米吧，啊，好羡慕你们能亲眼见证那些故事中的美景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"偷偷告诉你，和我们聊天的时候，谢莉卡可是把你当作偶像一样崇拜哦，说不定她选择去萨米也是在追寻你的脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没这回事啦......我并不是值得崇拜的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，你知道吗？谢莉卡已经去萨米了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能亲眼见到那些景色，她应该会很激动吧。真为她感到开心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这么晚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，布丁小姐，这里有一封你的信，是从萨米寄来的。署名是......谢莉卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，祝你夜晚愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是看看好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她说她已经进入了萨米境内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“前往萨米的路上，我想象了许多萨米的壮丽风光，但直到双脚踏上萨米的土地，我方知这片天地的辽阔，超越了我的思绪。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰色尾羽的羽兽腾空而起，树枝上的雪粉如花瓣般洒落。一朵蕈子撑开了晶莹剔透的伞面，就像盛满日光的玻璃碗。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这些奇异的景色让我无时无刻不沉醉其中。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面就是一些客套话啦，幸好没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，你别怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认，虽然有些不礼貌，但是最开始我是想装作没看到来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，爸妈每次寄信来老是会提到好多萨米的事让我回去，我担心她也会这样说，喊我一起去萨米什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我太害怕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，谢莉卡！我明天就给你回信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下面好像还有一段话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“对了，工程队的同事告诉我，萨米的春天马上就要来了。猜猜我在雪地里发现了什么？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“答案我就放在随信的相片里，布丁要记得想好再去看哦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相片......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，小抱枕，我们要先想一个答案再去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜还是蘑菇吗？那我......我就猜一块漂亮的冰块好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"揭晓答案的时候到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，雪......融化了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"草地上的积雪已然稀薄，露出零星的绿色。\n一朵粉色的花蕾褪去了白衣，悠然地在风中摇曳。\n相片将这个瞬间牢牢定格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好美丽的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，我们......是不是没有见过萨米的春天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我想的一样对吗？可是不行的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完结手上的工作，提交外出申请就要花好一阵子，等我们到了萨米，春天已经过去了吧，而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去不了那么远的地方啦......我们尝试过很多次的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我想到了，让谢莉卡帮我们拍更多的照片不就好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就给她写信！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“亲爱的谢莉卡......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁，谢莉卡的信还没到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算时间，马上又要两个月了，信该寄到了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好期待，都要没心思工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就要下班啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁今天不用加班吗？你已经在这里坐了半个小时啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"要不待会一起去找点东西吃吧！聊聊谢莉卡的“游记”。你能吃辣吗？烧烤呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我吗？都可以的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我最喜欢的情节就是谢莉卡把萨米人喂驮兽的饲料当作饼干吃了，哈哈哈，太好笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程队违背萨米人意愿修建设备，谢莉卡挺身而出，巧妙化解了一场冲突。那段才叫精彩啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁呢，你喜欢哪一段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家好呀！各位期待的——谢莉卡的萨米来信，到啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"快让我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢、慢点......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看这段，哈哈，笑得我肚子疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡说，工程队即将离开黑森林，他们正向着东北部的湿地进发......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“领队告诉我，我们在湿地的第一处驻扎点是在一片萨米人聚落附近，过去的工程队曾在聚落中架设了基本的电力设施。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我猜测有很大的可能，这就是当时你们所在的那片聚落。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“拥有电力后萨米人的生活变成了何种模样，我想你一定和我一样异常期待吧。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“虽然这一路上我也遇到了一些令我不愉快的事，但想到我的心愿终于可以在那里实现，我还是忍不住笑出声来。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你还记得那天你和我的交谈吗？之后我就决定了，今后也要用自己的技术去改变人们的生活。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“所以，我的心愿就是，我想要尽我所能优化聚落的电气系统。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“布丁，你能给我一些优化的建议吗？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁？你要走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，晚上我应该不能和大家一起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须......去做准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，鲍尔先生......嘶，走廊里好冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我早上过来就被冷气吹得直哆嗦，可是刚去查看了温控终端，走廊里的空调没有运作啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"冷风似乎不是从通风口里吹出来的......是在那个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那边是......电气工程实验室！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"冷、冷......啊，地上全是水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"是实验室进水了吗......有人在里面吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我做了防水处理的，防水鞋套我放在门边上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是布丁，你又在模拟工程环境吗？这次模拟的难道是......萨米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......准确地说，是萨米的湿地环境。我还是第一次在实验室里模拟这种自然环境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多咖啡袋......你不会一晚上都没有回去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有关系的......呃，抱歉，可以帮帮我吗？有个情况有点棘手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......哎哟，什么缠在我鞋子上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是我用线缆模拟的水草，请小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......你想要在萨米湿地里尝试最新的输电技术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这项技术的话，的确可以大大提升远距离输电的稳定性与可控性。确认可行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据之前建立的源石变电站与电力设备参数，理论上没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且谢莉卡也参与了技术的研发，设备改装和电缆敷设对她来说应该不算困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关键难点在于负荷控制。看这里，根据潮流计算的结果，改造后这一部分虽然能正常使用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但考虑到未来发展可能的用电高峰，负载就会严重超标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了很久，还是没有头绪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁小姐......我似乎曾经碰到过类似的问题，请稍等片刻，我把上次的方案拿给你看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"格雷伊抓着一沓文件，费劲地蹚水回来。\n之后他们认真地讨论着工程问题，全然没有在意没过脚踝的“沼泽”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邮件已经寄过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定，接下来就交给谢莉卡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位......耽误你们的时间帮我，实在是非常感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里，好不容易有个机会能帮上布丁的忙，我还很开心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，萨米的环境实在太复杂了，干扰因素多到光是看着就让人头疼。没有身临实地的情况下，也只有布丁能够考虑得这么细致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉卡，一定要完成啊，别出岔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很害怕，有我没有考虑到的因素......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁小姐的这套改造方案，完全能够满足一座现代化乡村的供电需求。请不要过于担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，别多想了，布丁已经做得很好了。不能实地考察的话，或多或少地都有一些因素缺失，无法避免的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟外面时刻都在发生变化，我们的脑子又没办法想象出一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然还是实地进行工程方案的考察更好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我们都知道布丁不喜欢出门，要是介意的话没有必要强迫自己啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这样......我是不是不能很好地帮助大家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是出门......我害怕自己又犯了错，或者遇上什么危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"这点......布丁小姐应该不用担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"如果布丁小姐想要试试出门，无论去哪里，我们都会陪着你的。就像现在这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小抱枕，谢莉卡的信还没有到呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，今天不加班了，只是想在这里待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要喝杯咖啡吗......但不加班的时候，很想念热可可的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起来不开心吗？你知道的，这段时间我一直很纠结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回想起来，来到罗德岛后，我承担的工作除了帮助大家落实想法，就是一些模拟实验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许这些事情让我产生了一种幻觉吧，认为自己就算一直待在封闭的环境中，也能够成为一名很好的电气工程师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是也许，外面的风里流动着时间，很多事情已经悄然改变了，我们什么都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕谢莉卡呀......好想知道，她见到了什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"布丁小姐，晚上好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谢莉卡来信了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，给你。祝你们夜晚愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"快拆开看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我等不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......欸？你们什么时候来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......恰好路过，对，我们是去拿热可可的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，这杯给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，别管我们了，快看看谢莉卡写了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“亲爱的布丁，接下来我要告诉你的事或许会让你很难接受，我见到时也被深深地震撼了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“让我组织一下语言......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一页下面都是空着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看下一张，好像有字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“当我们到达这片萨米聚落后，我惊讶地发现他们并未如我们想象的那般使用电力，或是其他任何现代设备。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“他们仍用最传统的做法为自己提供照明。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“事实上，这片萨米聚落的生活与多年前哥伦比亚探险队初次见到时没有什么不同，现代科技对他们的改变微乎其微。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......可那些笑容......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁......别难过，下面还有文字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，“但是，同样令我惊讶的是，他们并没有完全将现代科技弃之如敝屣。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“相反地，他们以一种独属于萨米的、令人讶异的方式与科技融洽相处。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"信封里似乎还有一张照片。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"光。\n在泪水模糊眼帘之前，布丁看见了光。\n毫无疑问，这些光芒来自现代文明，源石供应的电力激发发光二极管，释放出柔和的冷光。\n但是相片里没有任何一盏电灯的身影。\n她看见了一头长角的生物，步履款款地走出森林，就像从树梢抖落的第一片冰晶。\n它的皮毛正如月亮一般闪闪发光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是冰雕吗？我还以为是真的生物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，萨米人竟然将灯管塞进了冰雕，做出了闪亮的皮毛。太美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不承认，现在这是我最喜欢的一段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最下面......还有一段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在信页的最底部，谢莉卡写下了这么一段话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你看见了吗？我从未在书中读到有关萨米人这种行为的描述，可它们切实地出现在了我的面前。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你的努力并没有改变他们的生活，但这个结果......我却觉得一样美妙。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我不知道你有没有同样的感受。在看到这一幕时，我感受到了一种全新，但又普通的事物。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一种过去从未去主动感知的概念，却始终伴随在我们身边。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“萨米不是一个静止的雪景球，这片大地一直都超乎我们的想象。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“布丁，今后我仍要前进，但并非一定要为了改变什么。未来会自然地发生。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“仅仅是为了见证那些不同的风景，我就不能停滞不前。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不能停滞不前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没看错吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......布丁？在舰外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你们好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我在陪布丁做舰外的设备电路检修，这可是布丁来到本舰以来第一次离舰哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么看着我呀，不是我拉她出来的，是她自己决定的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"来的路上她可有干劲了，不信你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"char_253_greyy","isRemote":false,"text":"布丁......好像有点发抖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好可怕......好可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小、小抱枕......我果然还是不......不应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布丁","speakerId":"avg_4004_pudd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出门啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_253_greyy","aliases":["格雷伊"]}]}
